        "title": "Cloud tool callbacks resolve org identity correctly",
        "summary": "Direct cloud callbacks that only carry a zOS JWT now look up the Aura Network user before checking org membership, so tool actions like web search stop being rejected for authorized owners.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Server-side role checks now fetch the current Aura Network user when the JWT identity doesn't match an org member, cache the resolved network user ID and profile on the validation session, and rely on that identity for subsequent tool callbacks — with regression coverage via a new end-to-end web-search test.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "c394e572054a7da8c0bd3deabee38c2aaad94e81"
