        "started_at": "2026-07-10T13:39:51.000Z",
        "ended_at": "2026-07-10T13:39:51.000Z",
        "title": "macOS updater waits for shutdown before relaunching",
        "summary": "The desktop updater no longer races LaunchServices on macOS; a small handoff process waits for Aura to fully exit before reopening the freshly installed bundle.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Replaced the immediate `open -n` relaunch with a shell handoff that polls the parent PID (up to a 30-second ceiling) and only then execs `/usr/bin/open` on the new bundle, applied to both standard updates and the /Applications relocation path.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "c8307f12621f285e3f31a7e0d514e620be8aec7b"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Relaunch telemetry now records the handoff PID alongside the bundle path, making post-update failures easier to trace in the updater log.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "c8307f12621f285e3f31a7e0d514e620be8aec7b"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          }
        ]
      },
