        "title": "GPT-5.6 family added with a new XHigh reasoning tier",
        "summary": "The model catalog gains three GPT-5.6 variants and the reasoning-effort superset grows a distinct XHigh tier between High and Max.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Added GPT-5.6 Sol, Terra, and Luna to the model catalog and benchmark pricing tables, each with input/output and cache-read/write rates.",
